# Become Brutes at Bot1's Memnite and Ornithopter; in response Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Memnite. On resolution only the Ornithopter
# is still a legal target (CR 608.2b): the spell resolves for it alone, gaining haste and one Monster Role, and no Role is made for the
# Memnite, which is gone. Black Lotus pays {1}{R} and the Bolt's {R}.

